                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "35910833",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198037893332",
                            "num_reviews": 33,
                            "playtime_forever": 131,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 104,
                            "last_played": 1605761750
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "GTA2  style shooter/racing game. City is atmospheric, the lighting and music really set the mood. \nGame is fairly linear, Mafia 1 style, but there are challenges on the map that you can find/do. \nStory is told through Max Payne 1,2 style comic strips, you follow the story of garbage man who finds suitcase full of money and get's into bloody conflict with it's owners. \nCombat is quite punishing but interesting, both you and enemies can't take more than 2 hits so it's pretty kill or be killed explosive encounters. But the checkpoints aren't far so it does not get boring. \nProgression wise it has cool old GTA vibe, shooting/racing/chase someone/escape someone. Pacing is quite balanced. \n\nI have played with latest hotfix to date (22, Oct) and have not run into any crashes or bugs. \n\nI'd say it's a very good value for the money.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1508649835,
